    "flavor_text": {
        "sun": "Not only does it perceive auras, but it has also gained the power to control them. It employs them in battle.",
        "moon": "They can detect the species of a living being— and its emotions—from over half a mile away. They control auras and hunt their prey in packs.",
        "ultra-sun": "It concentrates its mental energy and fires off mysterious waves called auras, which can crush boulders of large size to dust.",
        "ultra-moon": "Lucario reads its opponent’s feelings with its aura waves. It finds out things it would rather not know, so it gets stressed out easily."
    },
